# Hold a channel for one owner at one priority for lease_s, renewed by calling again,
# released with lease_s 0. Offered as /expression/claim by every arbiter; each answers for
# its own channels and refuses the others with "not my channel".
string  channel
string  owner          # console, foxglove, a test, ...
uint8   priority       # ExpressionIntent/PRIORITY_*
float32 lease_s        # 0: release; the arbiter caps it at max_lease_s (default 60)
---
bool    accepted
string  reason         # empty when accepted; otherwise names the holder or the rule
ChannelStatus status   # the channel after the call
